# Added Flutterwave integration, gateway seed script, bulk processing endpoints, and telegram webhook handler

This commit adds the following:
- src/services/flutterwave.ts: sandbox-aware Flutterwave init and verify helpers
- Updated payments route to call real Flutterwave API when keys are configured and persist payments
- src/db/seed_gateways.ts: script to seed many gateways into the DB
- src/routes/bulk.ts: bulk job creation and status endpoints (simple worker simulation)
- src/routes/telegram.ts: basic Telegram webhook handler using integrations/telegram helper
- Added express-rate-limit and node-fetch to package.json
- Updated server index to register new routes and rate limiter

Next steps:
- Run migrations (npm run migrate) and then seed gateways (npm run seed:gateways)
- Provide sandbox FLW keys and Telegram token in .env (or test in simulated mode)
